#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/_security_footer.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette opération, changez votre mot de passe sans attendre et prévenez les organisateurs. Origine de la demande :\n"
"\n"
"- adresse IP : %(ip)s\n"
"- navigateur : %(user_agent)s\n"
"- date : %(timestamp)s"
msgstr ""
"If you did not make this change, change your password immediately and inform the organizers. The request came from:\n"
"\n"
"- IP address: %(ip)s\n"
"- browser: %(user_agent)s\n"
"- date: %(timestamp)s"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/_signature.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Cordialement,\n"
"L'équipe %(site_name)s\n"
"\n"
"Ce message a été envoyé automatiquement ; merci de ne pas y répondre."
msgstr ""
"Best regards,\n"
"The %(site_name)s team\n"
"\n"
"This message was sent automatically; please do not reply."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/account_already_exists_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Une inscription à %(site_name)s a été demandée avec cette adresse, mais un compte existe déjà. Vous pouvez vous connecter avec votre mot de passe ; si vous l'avez oublié, réinitialisez-le ici :\n"
"\n"
"%(password_reset_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, ignorez ce message : votre compte n'a pas été modifié."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"A %(site_name)s sign-up was requested with this address, but an account already exists. You can sign in with your password; if you have forgotten it, reset it here:\n"
"\n"
"%(password_reset_url)s\n"
"\n"
"If you did not make this request, ignore this message: your account has not been changed."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/account_already_exists_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Un compte existe déjà avec cette adresse"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] An account already exists with this address"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_added_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"L'adresse %(added_email)s vient d'être ajoutée à votre compte %(site_name)s. Elle ne pourra servir qu'une fois confirmée par le lien qui lui a été envoyé."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"The address %(added_email)s has just been added to your %(site_name)s account. It can only be used once confirmed through the link sent to it."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_added_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Une adresse e-mail a été ajoutée à votre compte"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] An email address was added to your account"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_changed_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"L'adresse principale de votre compte %(site_name)s est passée de %(from_email)s à %(to_email)s."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"The primary address of your %(site_name)s account has changed from %(from_email)s to %(to_email)s."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_changed_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Votre adresse e-mail principale a été modifiée"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Your primary email address was changed"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_confirmation_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Pour confirmer cette adresse sur votre compte %(site_name)s, ouvrez ce lien :\n"
"\n"
"%(activate_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, ignorez ce message."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"To confirm this address on your %(site_name)s account, open this link:\n"
"\n"
"%(activate_url)s\n"
"\n"
"If you did not make this request, ignore this message."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_confirmation_signup_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Un compte %(site_name)s vient d'être créé avec cette adresse. Pour l'activer, confirmez votre adresse en ouvrant ce lien :\n"
"\n"
"%(activate_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'avez pas créé de compte, ignorez ce message : aucun compte ne sera activé."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"A %(site_name)s account has just been created with this address. To activate it, confirm your address by opening this link:\n"
"\n"
"%(activate_url)s\n"
"\n"
"If you did not create an account, ignore this message: no account will be activated."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_confirmation_signup_subject.txt
#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_confirmation_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Confirmez votre adresse e-mail"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Confirm your email address"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_deleted_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"L'adresse %(deleted_email)s a été retirée de votre compte %(site_name)s."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"The address %(deleted_email)s was removed from your %(site_name)s account."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/email_deleted_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Une adresse e-mail a été retirée de votre compte"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] An email address was removed from your account"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_changed_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Le mot de passe de votre compte %(site_name)s vient d'être modifié."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"The password of your %(site_name)s account has just been changed."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_changed_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Votre mot de passe a été modifié"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Your password was changed"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_reset_key_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Une réinitialisation du mot de passe de votre compte %(site_name)s a été demandée. Pour choisir un nouveau mot de passe, ouvrez ce lien, valable deux heures et utilisable une seule fois :\n"
"\n"
"%(password_reset_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, ignorez ce message : votre mot de passe reste inchangé."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"A password reset was requested for your %(site_name)s account. To choose a new password, open this link, valid for two hours and usable only once:\n"
"\n"
"%(password_reset_url)s\n"
"\n"
"If you did not make this request, ignore this message: your password remains unchanged."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_reset_key_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Réinitialisation de votre mot de passe"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Reset your password"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_reset_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Le mot de passe de votre compte %(site_name)s vient d'être réinitialisé."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"The password of your %(site_name)s account has just been reset."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_reset_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Votre mot de passe a été réinitialisé"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Your password was reset"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_set_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Un mot de passe vient d'être défini pour votre compte %(site_name)s."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"A password has just been set for your %(site_name)s account."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_set_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Un mot de passe a été défini pour votre compte"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] A password was set for your account"

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/mfa_reset_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"À votre demande, l'équipe %(site_name)s a réinitialisé la double authentification de votre compte (%(timestamp)s). Activez-la de nouveau depuis la page « Sécurité » de votre compte ; un rôle de gestion l'exige.\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, prévenez les organisateurs sans attendre."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"At your request, the %(site_name)s team reset the two-factor authentication of your account (%(timestamp)s). Enable it again from the “Security” page of your account; management roles require it.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not make this request, let the organisers know right away."

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/mfa_reset_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Double authentification réinitialisée"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Two-factor authentication reset"

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/recovery_codes_generated_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"De nouveaux codes de secours pour la double authentification ont été générés sur votre compte %(site_name)s. Les anciens codes ne sont plus valables."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"New two-factor authentication recovery codes were generated for your %(site_name)s account. The previous codes are no longer valid."

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/recovery_codes_generated_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Nouveaux codes de secours"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] New recovery codes"

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/totp_activated_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"La double authentification (application TOTP) vient d'être activée sur votre compte %(site_name)s. Conservez vos codes de secours en lieu sûr."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Two-factor authentication (TOTP app) has just been enabled on your %(site_name)s account. Keep your recovery codes somewhere safe."

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/totp_activated_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Double authentification activée"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Two-factor authentication enabled"

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/totp_deactivated_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"La double authentification (application TOTP) vient d'être désactivée sur votre compte %(site_name)s. Si votre compte a un rôle de gestion, vous devrez la réactiver pour accéder à l'espace de gestion."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Two-factor authentication (TOTP app) has just been disabled on your %(site_name)s account. If your account has a management role, you will need to enable it again to access the management area."

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/totp_deactivated_subject.txt
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Double authentification désactivée"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Two-factor authentication disabled"

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/invitation_link_message.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Une personne connectée à %(site_name)s demande à rattacher cette adresse à son compte pour accepter une invitation à l'édition %(edition_code)s. Si c'est vous, ouvrez ce lien depuis le même compte, dans l'heure :\n"
"\n"
"%(link_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, ignorez ce message : l'adresse ne sera pas rattachée."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
